flowchart TD
  NOAA[NOAA Storm Events annual gzip CSV] --> ACQ[Explicit cached acquisition CLI]
  GHCN[NCEI GHCN-Daily metric CSV] --> ACQ
  ACQ --> RAW[Raw landing: unchanged responses, URL, UTC capture, SHA-256]
  RAW --> SUB[Registered CSV input: Oklahoma subset or unchanged station response]
  SUB --> B[TaskFlow Bronze: verify checksum and atomically publish JSON view]
  SCHED[Airflow scheduler / LocalExecutor] --> B
  B --> TRIG[TriggerDagRunOperator: exact manifest path]
  B --> BJ[Bronze JSON batch on persistent bind mount]
  TRIG --> FS[Silver FileSensor: exact batch, reschedule, timeout]
  BJ --> FS
  FS --> VAL[Source parsing and canonical validation]
  VAL --> DB[(PostgreSQL/PostGIS: accepted rows, domains, revisions, provenance)]
  VAL --> Q[(rejected_record: raw fields and reason)]
  DB --> STATE[Run metrics and partition checkpoint in same transaction]
  STATE --> P[Silver Parquet: immutable run snapshot]
  P --> NOTE[Offline Pandas review notebook]
  DB -. planned .-> GOLD[Gold: regional analytical views / CHI]
  GOLD -. planned .-> DASH[Dashboard]
  CLI[Historical / status ingestion CLI] --> VAL
